2021-09-16 13:11:20 +0300  Sebastian Dröge <sebastian@centricular.com>

	* gst/multifile/gstsplitmuxsink.c:
	  splitmuxsink: Use GST_CLOCK_STIME_NONE instead of 0 to initialize max out running time
