2019-08-26 08:03:24 +0200  Niels De Graef <nielsdegraef@gmail.com>

	* ext/cairo/gstcairooverlay.c:
	* ext/raw1394/gstdv1394src.c:
	* ext/shout2/gstshout2.c:
