2019-06-24 14:28:39 +0300  Mart Raudsepp <mart.raudsepp@collabora.com>

	* gst/audioparsers/gstaacparse.c:
	* gst/audioparsers/gstac3parse.c:
	* gst/audioparsers/gstamrparse.c:
